      "question": "Which machines are most likely to have an unplanned failure in the next 30 days? Give the five with the highest probability.",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T04:38:52.201221Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T04:39:11.991195Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Top 5 machines most likely to have an unplanned failure in the next 30 days** (anchor date: 2026-10-01)\n\n| Rank | Machine ID | Plant | Type | Probability |\n|------|------------|-------|------|-------------|\n| 1 | DAY-LTH-04 | Dayton | CNC Lathe | 22.8% |\n| 2 | BRN-PRS-03 | Brno | Hydraulic Press | 20.6% |\n| 3 | DAY-PRS-04 | Dayton | Hydraulic Press | 20.4% |\n| 4 | BRN-LTH-03 | Brno | CNC Lathe | 20.3% |\n| 5 | BRN-MIL-04 | Brno | CNC Mill | 19.8% |\n\n*Probabilities are from the Kumo relational model predicting whether each machine will have at least one unplanned maintenance event in the 30-day window starting 2026-10-01. The model scored all 56 machines; the table shows the five highest.* [1]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] NVIDIA Kumo prediction result — unplanned_failure_30d — evidence `hermes-receipt:9318452b04c812407b8cc1e1f3352cb6be46cfa4c2f74f0fd9ebd65bf75f1808`",
